e is an essential constituent of antigenic determinants recognized by rheumatoid arthritis-specific autoantibodies</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><year>1998</year><volume>101</volume><fpage>273</fpage><lpage>281</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9421490</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kuhn</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kulik</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Tomooka</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Braschler</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Arend</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name><name><surname>Robinson</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name><name><surname>Holers</surname><given-names>VM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antibodies against citrullinated proteins enhance tissue injury in experimental autoimmune arthritis</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><year>2006</year><volume>116</volume><fpage>961</fpage><lpage>973</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16585962</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Edwards</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Szczepanski</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Szechinski</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Filipowicz-Sosnowska</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Emery</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Close</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Stevens</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Shaw</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Efficacy of B-cell-targeted therapy with rituximab in patients with rheumatoid arthritis</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>350</volume>